  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:shuvah_adonai_challetzah">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/1"/>Return Adonoy, free our souls,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/2"/>and deliver us for the sake of Your kindliness.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/3"/>Return, return, You have said to us,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/4"/>regarding repentance,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/5"/>from the very beginning of creation
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/6"/>You promised to accept it.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/7"/>The correct offering to God
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/8"/>is a broken spirit,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/9"/>a broken and humbled heart,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/10"/>God will not despise.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/11"/>Let come before You
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/12"/>the groaning of the prisoner [of sin],
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/13"/>according to the greatness of Your power
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/14"/>set free those condemned to die.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/15"/>Grant truth to Jacob,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/16"/>kindliness to Abraham,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/17"/>as You have sworn to our fathers
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:shuvah_adonai_challetzah/18"/>from the days of old.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
